# What `git archive` -- and so the GitHub release zipball, which Zenodo
# archives -- leaves out: the lab (lab/, the dnsjax-lab package), which
# is developed here but never released, every file written for coding
# agents (the CLAUDE.md notes, .claude/), and the development
# configuration (CI, git and hook settings).  The PyPI sdist holds the
# same files but uv.lock (pyproject.toml's source-include).
/lab export-ignore
/.claude export-ignore
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.python-version export-ignore
/prek.toml export-ignore
